It is safe to call this function from any thread.

Returns SDL3::IOStream object or undef: a pointer to a new SDL_IOStream structure or NULL on failure; call SDL_GetError() for more information.

Since: This function is available since SDL 3.2.0.

=head2 SDL_OpenIO

