=head1 ENUMERATIONS

Every enumerator is exported as a constant sub.

=head2 SDL_IOStatus

SDL_IOStream status, set by a read or write operation.

=over

=item SDL_IO_STATUS_READY = 0 - Everything is ready (no errors and not EOF).

=item SDL_IO_STATUS_ERROR = 1 - Read or write I/O error

=item SDL_IO_STATUS_EOF = 2 - End of file

=item SDL_IO_STATUS_NOT_READY = 3 - Non blocking I/O, not ready

=item SDL_IO_STATUS_READONLY = 4 - Tried to write a read-only buffer

=item SDL_IO_STATUS_WRITEONLY = 5 - Tried to read a write-only buffer

=back

=head2 SDL_IOWhence

Possible `whence` values for SDL_IOStream seeking.

=over

=item SDL_IO_SEEK_SET = 0 - Seek from the beginning of data

=item SDL_IO_SEEK_CUR = 1 - Seek relative to current read point

=item SDL_IO_SEEK_END = 2 - Seek relative to the end of data

=back



